{"title":"Career Roadmap: Sales Manager (Junior)","role":"Sales Manager (Junior)","summary":"Career-entry note: A graduate may enter sales as a Sales Executive, Business Development Executive, Sales Development Representative or similar role and progress into a Junior Sales Manager position after gaining relevant sales experience. A managerial title is not typically guaranteed immediately after graduation.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA - Marketing"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in selling, customer acquisition, territory management, sales operations, team coordination and revenue growth"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Junior Sales Manager supports revenue generation by managing sales activities, customers, territories and/or a small sales team."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales planning"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Prospecting"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Sales target management"},{"text":"Pipeline management"},{"text":"Territory management"},{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Performance tracking"},{"text":"Sales reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA Marketing student, the ideal combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketing","Sales","Customer Psychology","Business Analytics","CRM","Negotiation","Leadership"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & marketing foundation"},{"text":"Management, economics, accounting, consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing case study"},{"text":"Weak business fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Sales capability"},{"text":"Selling, communication, customer psychology, digital marketing"},{"text":"Sales simulation"},{"text":"Only theoretical marketing"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Sales operations & analytics"},{"text":"CRM, forecasting, territory planning, Excel, Power BI"},{"text":"Sales dashboard + CRM project"},{"text":"No measurable sales exposure"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Leadership & execution"},{"text":"Sales strategy, negotiation, team management, internship"},{"text":"Sales capstone + internship"},{"text":"Expecting managerial role without sales experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Introduction to Marketing"},{"text":"MS Excel"},{"text":"Presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"Professional communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales Management"},{"text":"Marketing Management"},{"text":"Retail/Distribution Management"},{"text":"Customer Relationship Management"},{"text":"Business Research"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B2B & B2C Sales"},{"text":"Integrated Marketing Communications"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Channel Management"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Sales Management"},{"text":"Key Account Management"},{"text":"Sales Forecasting"},{"text":"Territory Management"},{"text":"Sales Force Management"},{"text"