mentation"]}]},{"heading":"Sales Prospecting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn multiple acquisition methods."},{"type":"h","text":"Outbound"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cold calling"},{"text":"Cold emailing"},{"text":"LinkedIn outreach"},{"text":"Referral generation"},{"text":"Account-based prospecting"},{"text":"Industry events"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inbound"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website leads"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Webinars"},{"text":"Product enquiries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Qualification"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICP"},{"text":"Buyer persona"},{"text":"BANT"},{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Authority"},{"text":"Need"},{"text":"Timeline"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to identify high-quality opportunities, not simply maximize lead volume."}]},{"heading":"Customer Psychology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A sales professional should understand why customers buy."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer needs"},{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Buying motivations"},{"text":"Perceived value"},{"text":"Price sensitivity"},{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Social proof"},{"text":"Risk perception"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Customer objections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to distinguish:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Feature","Benefit","Customer Value"]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"note","label":"Feature","text":"Automated reporting\nBenefit: Reduces manual reporting work\nValue: Saves employee time and improves decision-making speed"}]},{"heading":"Sales Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cold calling"},{"text":"Email writing"},{"text":"Discovery questioning"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Product presentation"},{"text":"Demo skills"},{"text":"Proposal writing"},{"text":"Objection handling"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Closing"},{"text":"Follow-up"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Common Objections"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"\"The price is too high.\""},{"text":"\"We already use another provider.\""},{"text":"\"We don't have the budget.\""},{"text":"\"Send me the details.\""},{"text":"\"We need approval.\""},{"text":"\"This isn't a priority.\""}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn to diagnose the real reason behind the objection instead of immediately offering a discount."}]},{"heading":"Sales Negotiation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BATNA"},{"text":"Reservation point"},{"text":"Value-based negotiation"},{"text":"Price anchoring"},{"text":"Concessions"},{"text":"Trade-offs"},{"text":"Contract terms"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Volume discounts"},{"text":"Renewal negotiation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong salesperson should negotiate around value and commercial terms, not only price."}]},{"heading":"Sales Territory Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how sales managers organize markets."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geographic territories"},{"text":"Industry territories"},{"text":"Account-based territories"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Territory potential"},{"text":"Account prioritization"},{"text":"Sales representative allocation"},{"text":"Travel planning"},{"text":"Territory performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hyderabad","Enterprise Accounts","IT/Technology","High-potential accounts","Assigned sales representative"]}]},{"heading":"Sales Pipeline Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Lead","Qualified","Opportunity","Proposal","Negotiation","Closed Won/Lost"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pipeline coverage"},{"text":"Pipeline velocity"},{